  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): INV-mozaf-sopam (file-accounting gap, 296 files contribute no path-bearing IR, of which 107 are markdown) is the umbrella metric for this finding; INV-gosub is the markdown-specific instance and one of the two languages INV-mozaf names directly. Closing INV-gosub by emitting file/section nodes per markdown file will close the markdown half of INV-mozaf's 296-file gap; the yaml half (174 files) is a separate unbuilt-analyzer instance. Code site: packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/markdown.py; the analyzer never emits a file Symbol (compare bash.py module_symbol pattern) and _make_link_dst_id has no path-canonicalization."  # c660
