  message: "RE-SCOPED (2026-07-13, hygiene sweep). Both filed headline symptoms are STALE/false on dev 8eef2da94d — VERIFIED on a fresh docs/adr slice: (1) 'zero file/section nodes for markdown' is FALSE — 47 markdown file nodes emit for 47 .md files (via the orchestrator file-symbol-synthesis chokepoint added after the 2026-05-30 filing); (2) '102 orphan doc_link externals' is FALSE — 0 external_symbol nodes, 0 orphans in the default map. The DATA-LOSS face is closed. Downgraded P1->P3: the genuine RESIDUAL is confined to the opt-in --include-docs docs graph — internal doc links resolve to synthetic <external> placeholders instead of the real in-repo file/section nodes, and identical targets duplicate for lack of path canonicalization (no markdown-link-resolver linker exists). No default-map consumer harm. A separately-found pipeline dropout (docs/adr/0037 yields 19 section symbols from the analyzer but 0 nodes even under --include-docs) is filed as its own follow-up. INV-mozaf's stale root_cause ('markdown only emits external :doc_link nodes') should be corrected."  # 466a
